      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a396d000fd56a50e638ffae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个！So good！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47bade85f49b86135fe70b67a02b5ef518f1e3e3ae14366114e1a1f21b2a667e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89aebda8e4006c2e970017d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得身体好沉重……\r\n但我、还是想飞向世界……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfdb5d831cb761ae55499b60e6ddc442b95e15ce4f817570999648c1659643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95be017994f34ae15ceefc3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界还在等着我呢……\r\n我怎么能这么软弱……no～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c62d4d02c46ea891927f34f36d4c6f04020b2a9694871a6ec3c35a2f43f6877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0c6c6bfdebba2e0a6ef3fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵～呵呵呵！\r\n今天也闪耀着max的光芒！\r\n嗯嗯～！Precious！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ebc9fcdab89f2b8ae7ba5bd58940195b01854ac44adec075626d4398d3c4da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22540c93c50c78264223d21d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这颗最高质量的珍珠，\r\n即将改变世界！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b5cbf3a5276ce7ab3a6081caf3c6ca7508fb4d6e9cdb65a56f267062252347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb2c11903be79762518089f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hey hey hey！今天要做\r\n什么训练？我会证明\r\n对我来说没有不可能的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a6e91b9a8721b77dc88085d5b569fa6f0b637d4cae97c8e5843be3d39977b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b95b20eec18e791bad52536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很good！\r\n精神也很great！\r\n嗯嗯～我感到充满活力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fd30eb5e8d3ebd03370967ebdb559e3942b92003863db12d1a676fb1bab825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cfeb97c635176c64a1e896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续探究未知的潜能……\r\n开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8ed5485c4d2a33e640036467bda9532b40e17e7f140e55339124011bf07653f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c00c2ff735d6cb7fd4a8e51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要让我这颗珍珠更加闪耀喔。\r\n好啦，训练员，give me指示吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "600a4f22e436f927aac22b4c623a5aa7ff2b9e6096e8d8751d56560dff692ef8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:848987a8220adac08030ad95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh，ennui……\r\n真想到远方旅行，\r\nrefresh一下心情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0122430d940f94b918eeeec6b9ac3626053fe1d6f393b976b0e8d8fb801133a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11e0d17fb80d7be1fed6b2ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～要concentration啰！\r\n加油啊采珠……你一定做得到。\r\n嗯嗯～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "85abe2a7f8c7c7087f57463b17aade00b38f788a5f7d1a56ed0497f3aaed46fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14f434999ee53040c21f578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论再好的珍珠都得仔细打磨，\r\n不然光芒会变得黯淡。\r\n要牢牢记住喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d1935d3d653e9b5ee5edb1a539878c156307b2415cfc3d8955912c4b11aa3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f40bbbdf8416f602746933c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～～～～～\r\n训练？Uh-huh……\r\n现在我觉得no thank you……",
      "source_fingerprint": "399685467a5814594cb388815ee84c2eff541e1db163ca10a7fb58cc37669a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b943aa1269e7d2e0bbc4ebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～看来你一定深信我就算连续参赛\r\n也能够获胜吧。不过……\r\n冷静地判断也是很重要的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54d78115af7f8b79320f54598b0fc1a7ff48fcad21aff5582af6b11012c77401",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e695a8b00f305f72e8bcac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh……又要比赛啊？\r\n抱歉，我not agree。\r\n挑战世界时休息也是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "770e1579d5632d4a1e5a881b5342925721cca2a34501fce0e955f14beceb218b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e879d79008b09941d3d219",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我是无敌的！\r\n找遍全地球也没人能赢过我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ad1c5a5584c3934b5b08dca32c6536da12c179c5806c48b9a7d973d9d11a1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6084e849ed274e5a6e5adb8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵～呵呵呵呵！\r\nPerfect！Amazing！\r\n嗯嗯～～我一定会获得Victory！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c808febb1dcd34d0150e4a5ff755c6d56444293992951313b248edc2d090fb65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b581818855fb869464d82864",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这颗特大珍珠将绽放光芒，\r\n让全世界！跟你！\r\n都对我着迷不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6831eb281bd8740e9110f6784463b0e0b2d825a5d03ae29e267c1a20992233b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66192d00b7c1660bd0a46c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～so good！状况绝佳！\r\n尽情期待采珠绽放光芒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48fb6095b83a8e293b7d5bf32ee6401720336df1e263f9fbea7ae0274c439a51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:528bf085367c0b13e6f4cd80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……今早喝茶时，杯中的茶叶梗\r\n全都为我起身喝采呢……！\r\n看了真是充满动力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86609b2367e9b1eeb4f89dca1ce73eb5f6dda60a7920e04254c0050fa9a6696a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d28533738ce880f7b13c2033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Active地向前进吧！\r\nGet胜利！And……\r\nTo the world！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7954e14c2e56ea33c2b86b57b4e75990eae7efb2971cb1fbd30243dd56b30a9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
